          "details": "<ul><li>This creature cannot be targeted with<strong> melee attacks</strong> as long as it is in mid-air.</li><li>If this creature suffers damage of a type they are <strong>Vulnerable</strong> to, they lose the benefits of this Skill until the end of the round.</li><li><p>This creature may also be forced to land by spending an <strong>opportunity</strong>. As long as it is in <strong>@UUID[JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM]{Crisis}</strong>, it loses all benefits granted by this Skill.</p></li></ul>",
